    {
        "content": "<p>I think the imports changed and we don't use Std.Do anymore?</p>",
        "id": 633811389,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1792628096
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I had to adapt Algolean to vcgen for v4.35.0 and these failures happened there because the imports have changed</p>",
        "id": 633811427,
        "sender_full_name": "Shreyas Srinivas",
        "timestamp": 1792628108
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think I'd argue this is still a bug; if you use <code>mvcgen</code> with the wrong imports, it tells you to import something:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`mvcgen</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">please</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Do</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 633811595,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1792628179
    },
